flowchart LR
    IN[title / body / ticker / meta]
    NF[Normalizar NFC + casefold]
    OTP[OTP: 4-15 digitos cerca de keyword o app sensible]
    CARD[Tarjeta: 13-19 digitos]
    IBAN[IBAN]
    TEL[Telefono: partial / full / off]
    OUT[Texto redactado + informe]
    IN --> NF
    NF --> OTP
    OTP -->|si| OUT
    NF --> CARD
    CARD -->|si| OUT
    NF --> IBAN
    IBAN -->|si| OUT
    NF --> TEL
    TEL --> OUT
